{
  "about": [
    "One console line -> the words redis receives (SPEC §data.redis-console). The server splits with",
    "swiss_host::dbbrowser::split_words (shlex, less its '#'-comment rule); the panel counts",
    "words for completion with the vendored JS shlex port. Both suites read this file: a",
    "line's `words` is the server's answer (null = refused), `panel` is where the JS port",
    "differs and `why` says why that is harmless. `keys` are names the console completion",
    "types for the operator (`typed`, from dbRedisQuoteArg) - `GET <typed>` must hand redis",
    "exactly that name on both sides."
  ],
